LUN 01
; TESELA.lun  -  a lunar file  -  V01
; the bridge between OLYMPASS.WORLD and RIVER.COM
; glyphs are the Astral & Found-Moon Glyph Maker set, kept as 16 x 16 pixel bitmaps
; (one row = 4 hex digits, top bit = leftmost pixel). no keyboard emoji, no iOS characters.

